{"id": "eff59219-bd86-4bd2-b682-15d36b2ce864", "slug": "aether-metrics-orbital-scheduling", "title": "AETHER METRICS — Orbital Scheduling", "description": "Aether Metrics Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"AETHER METRICS — Orbital Scheduling\"\ndescription: \"Aether Metrics Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F59E0B\"\n  secondary: \"#050505\"\n  accent: \"#F59E0B\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#1A1510\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# AETHER METRICS — Orbital Scheduling\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 23; favorites: 5; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, charts, security, legal.\n## Overview\nAether Metrics Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nAETHER METRICS Precision Logistics FLIGHT AM-09 Next transfer window T-00:00: 00 Dedicated payload slots on our weekly heavy-lift manifests. Secure your trajectory, generate your telemetry, and monitor the ascent. LEO 5…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: AETHER METRICS.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F59E0B, secondary #050505, accent #F59E0B, background #050505, surface #1A1510, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>AETHER METRICS — Orbital Scheduling</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-neutral-200 font-sans overflow-hidden h-screen w-screen relative antialiased selection:bg-amber-500/30 selection:text-amber-200\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"gl\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 opacity-0\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- UI Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full h-full pointer-events-none flex flex-col justify-between p-6 md:p-10\">\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full pointer-events-auto\">\n            <div class=\"js-ui-top-left opacity-0 transform -translate-x-8\">\n                <h1 class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-neutral-300 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:planet-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-amber-500 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                    AETHER METRICS\n                </h1>\n                <p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase text-neutral-600\">Precision Logistics</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Patch / Border Gradient -->\n            <div class=\"js-ui-top-right opacity-0 transform scale-90 origin-top-right\">\n                <div class=\"js-magnetic rounded-full p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/40 via-neutral-600/20 to-transparent w-20 h-20 md:w-24 md:h-24 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(245,158,11,0.05)] cursor-pointer\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-full w-full h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-mono text-[9px] md:text-[10px] tracking-widest text-neutral-400 text-center leading-relaxed\">\n                        <span class=\"text-amber-500 mb-0.5\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rocket-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon></span>\n                        FLIGHT<br><span class=\"text-neutral-200 font-semibold\">AM-09</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Main Stage -->\n        <main class=\"w-full max-w-3xl absolute top-1/2 left-6 md:left-10 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-auto pr-6\">\n            <div class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex mb-2\">\n                <p class=\"js-reveal-text font-mono text-xs md:text-sm tracking-[0.3em] text-amber-500 uppercase transform translate-y-full\">Next transfer window</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col mt-2 mb-6\">\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex\">\n                    <p class=\"js-reveal-text font-mono text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl tracking-tighter text-neutral-100 leading-none transform translate-y-full\" id=\"count\">\n                        T-00:00:<em class=\"not-italic text-amber-500 font-semibold\">00</em>\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex max-w-md\">\n                <p class=\"js-reveal-text text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400 font-normal transform translate-y-full\">\n                    Dedicated payload slots on our weekly heavy-lift manifests. Secure your trajectory, generate your telemetry, and monitor the ascent.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- Footer -->\n        <footer class=\"flex justify-between items-end w-full pointer-events-auto\">\n            <!-- Routes -->\n            <div class=\"js-ui-bottom-left flex gap-2 md:gap-3 opacity-0 transform translate-y-8\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Orbit Selection\">\n                <!-- Custom Toggles / Buttons with gradient active states -->\n                <button class=\"js-route-btn js-magnetic relative px-5 py-3 md:px-6 md:py-4 rounded-full border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-950/50 backdrop-blur-sm text-neutral-400 font-mono text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-widest uppercase transition-all duration-500 ease-out hover:border-neutral-600 focus:outline-none\" data-r=\"0\" data-active=\"true\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500/20 to-transparent opacity-100 js-active-bg transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-amber-500/50 opacity-100 js-active-border transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-start text-neutral-200 js-active-text transition-colors duration-500\">\n                        LEO\n                        <span class=\"text-[8px] md:text-[9px] tracking-widest text-amber-500/80 mt-1 js-active-sub transition-colors duration-500\">550 KM</span>\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n\n                <button class=\"js-route-btn js-magnetic relative px-5 py-3 md:px-6 md:py-4 rounded-full border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-950/50 backdrop-blur-sm text-neutral-500 font-mono text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-widest uppercase transition-all duration-500 ease-out hover:border-neutral-600 focus:outline-none\" data-r=\"1\" data-active=\"false\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500/20 to-transparent opacity-0 js-active-bg transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-amber-500/50 opacity-0 js-active-border transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-start js-active-text transition-colors duration-500\">\n                        GTO\n                        <span class=\"text-[8px] md:text-[9px] tracking-widest text-neutral-600 mt-1 js-active-sub transition-colors duration-500\">35,786 KM</span>\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n\n                <button class=\"js-route-btn js-magnetic relative hidden sm:block px-5 py-3 md:px-6 md:py-4 rounded-full border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-950/50 backdrop-blur-sm text-neutral-500 font-mono text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-widest uppercase transition-all duration-500 ease-out hover:border-neutral-600 focus:outline-none\" data-r=\"2\" data-active=\"false\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500/20 to-transparent opacity-0 js-active-bg transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-amber-500/50 opacity-0 js-active-border transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-start js-active-text transition-colors duration-500\">\n                        LUNAR\n                        <span class=\"text-[8px] md:text-[9px] tracking-widest text-neutral-600 mt-1 js-active-sub transition-colors duration-500\">384,400 KM</span>\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- ETA -->\n            <div class=\"js-ui-bottom-right text-right opacity-0 transform translate-x-8\">\n                <p class=\"font-mono text-[9px] md:text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-neutral-500 mb-1 flex justify-end items-center gap-1.5\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:clock-circle-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Est. Duration\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"font-mono text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-tight text-neutral-200\" id=\"eta\">14 hours</p>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- WebGL Background (Obsidian/Amber theme, no blue/purple) ---\n        const cv = document.getElementById('gl'), gl = cv.getContext('webgl');\n        let route = 0, routeSm = 0;\n\n        if (gl) {\n            const F = `precision highp float;uniform vec2 u_res;uniform float u_time;uniform float u_route;\n            float h21(vec2 p){p=fract(p*vec2(123.34,456.21));p+=dot(p,p+45.32);return fract(p.x*p.y);}\n            void main(){\n                vec2 p=(gl_FragCoord.xy-.5*u_res)/u_res.y;\n                float t=u_time;\n\n                // Obsidian/Dark grey base instead of blue\n                vec3 col=vec3(.03,.03,.035);\n\n                // Stars\n                vec2 sp=floor(gl_FragCoord.xy/2.2);\n                float s=h21(sp);\n                float tw=.5+.5*sin(t*(1.+s*3.)+s*40.);\n                col+=vec3(.9,.85,.7)*step(.997,s)*tw*.6;\n                col+=vec3(.4,.4,.4)*step(.998,h21(sp+9.))*.4;\n\n                // Planet setup\n                vec2 pc=vec2(0.,-1.62);\n                float pd=length(p-pc);\n                float planet=smoothstep(1.32,1.315,pd);\n                float rim=exp(-abs(pd-1.32)*14.);\n\n                // Atmosphere transitioning based on route, strictly amber/gold/neutral\n                vec3 atmo=mix(vec3(.6,.4,.15),vec3(.8,.6,.2),u_route*.4);\n\n                // Planet surface\n                col=mix(col,vec3(.01,.01,.01),planet);\n\n                // City lights (gold)\n                float terms=smoothstep(.5,.9,h21(floor((p-pc)*30.)+floor(t*.2)));\n                col+=vec3(.8,.6,.2)*planet*step(.994,h21(floor((p-pc)*60.)))*.6;\n                col+=atmo*rim*.6;\n\n                // Orbit Rings\n                float R=mix(.52,.95,u_route*.5+.5*smoothstep(1.5,2.,u_route));\n                float orbd=abs(length(p-pc)-(1.32+R*.42));\n                float orbit=exp(-orbd*150.)*.3;\n                col+=vec3(.5,.48,.4)*orbit;\n\n                // Satellite & Trail (Amber)\n                float ang=atan(p.y-pc.y,p.x-pc.x);\n                float sat=fract(ang/6.2832-t*.04);\n                float satG=exp(-orbd*100.)*exp(-pow(sat*16.,2.))*2.0;\n                float trail=exp(-orbd*100.)*smoothstep(.3,0.,sat)*.4;\n                col+=vec3(.9,.6,.1)*(satG+trail);\n\n                // Vignette & Grain\n                col*=1.-length(p*vec2(.6,.8))*.4;\n                float gr=h21(gl_FragCoord.xy+t)*.03;\n                gl_FragColor=vec4(col+gr,1.);\n            }`;\n            const V = 'attribute vec2 p;void main(){gl_Position=vec4(p,0.,1.);}';\n\n            function sh(t, s) {\n                const o = gl.createShader(t); gl.shaderSource(o, s); gl.compileShader(o);\n                return o;\n            }\n            const pr = gl.createProgram();\n            gl.attachShader(pr, sh(gl.VERTEX_SHADER, V));\n            gl.attachShader(pr, sh(gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER, F));\n            gl.linkProgram(pr); gl.useProgram(pr);\n\n            gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, gl.createBuffer());\n            gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, new Float32Array([-1, -1, 3, -1, -1, 3]), gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n\n            const lp = gl.getAttribLocation(pr, 'p');\n            gl.enableVertexAttribArray(lp);\n            gl.vertexAttribPointer(lp, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n\n            const U = n => gl.getUniformLocation(pr, n);\n            const uR = U('u_res'), uT = U('u_time'), uRt = U('u_route');\n\n            function resize() {\n                cv.width = innerWidth * Math.min(devicePixelRatio, 2);\n                cv.height = innerHeight * Math.min(devicePixelRatio, 2);\n                gl.viewport(0, 0, cv.width, cv.height);\n            }\n            addEventListener('resize', resize); resize();\n\n            let t0 = performance.now();\n            (function loop(now) {\n                const t = (now - t0) / 1000;\n                routeSm += (route - routeSm) * 0.05;\n                gl.uniform2f(uR, cv.width, cv.height);\n                gl.uniform1f(uT, t);\n                gl.uniform1f(uRt, routeSm);\n                gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLES, 0, 3);\n                requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n            })(t0);\n        } else {\n            // Fallback if no WebGL\n            document.body.style.background = \"radial-gradient(100% 100% at 50% 100%, #1a1510 0%, #050505 100%)\";\n        }\n\n        // --- UI Logic & Animations ---\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n\n            // Route Selection Logic\n            const etas = ['14 hours', '3.2 days', '6.5 days'];\n            const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.js-route-btn');\n\n            buttons.forEach(btn => {\n                btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                    // Reset all\n                    buttons.forEach(b => {\n                        b.setAttribute('data-active', 'false');\n                        b.querySelector('.js-active-bg').style.opacity = '0';\n                        b.querySelector('.js-active-border').style.opacity = '0';\n                        b.querySelector('.js-active-text').classList.replace('text-neutral-200', 'text-neutral-500');\n                        b.querySelector('.js-active-sub').classList.replace('text-amber-500/80', 'text-neutral-600');\n                    });\n\n                    // Set active\n                    btn.setAttribute('data-active', 'true');\n                    btn.querySelector('.js-active-bg').style.opacity = '1';\n                    btn.querySelector('.js-active-border').style.opacity = '1';\n                    btn.querySelector('.js-active-text').classList.replace('text-neutral-500', 'text-neutral-200');\n                    btn.querySelector('.js-active-sub').classList.replace('text-neutral-600', 'text-amber-500/80');\n\n                    route = +btn.dataset.r;\n\n                    // Animate ETA change\n                    gsap.to(\"#eta\", {\n                        opacity: 0, y: -10, duration: 0.2, ease: \"power2.in\",\n                        onComplete: () => {\n                            document.getElementById('eta').textContent = etas[route];\n                            gsap.to(\"#eta\", { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 0.3, ease: \"power2.out\" });\n                        }\n                    });\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Countdown Logic\n            const count = document.getElementById('count');\n            const T0 = Date.now() + 1000 * 60 * 60 * 42.7; // arbitrary future time\n            setInterval(() => {\n                const d = Math.max(0, T0 - Date.now());\n                const h = String(Math.floor(d / 3.6e6)).padStart(2, '0');\n                const m = String(Math.floor(d / 6e4) % 60).padStart(2, '0');\n                const s = String(Math.floor(d / 1e3) % 60).padStart(2, '0');\n                count.innerHTML = `T-${h}:${m}:<em class=\"not-italic text-amber-500 font-semibold\">${s}</em>`;\n            }, 250);\n\n            // Entry Animations (Sharp, staggering, non-floating)\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: \"power4.out\" } });\n\n            tl.to(\"#gl\", { opacity: 1, duration: 2, ease: \"power2.inOut\" }, 0)\n              .to(\".js-ui-top-left\", { x: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 1.5 }, 0.5)\n              .to(\".js-ui-top-right\", { scale: 1, opacity: 1, duration: 1.5, ease: \"expo.out\" }, 0.6)\n              .to(\".js-reveal-text\", { y: \"0%\", stagger: 0.1, duration: 1.2 }, 0.7)\n              .to(\".js-ui-bottom-left\", { y: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 1.2 }, 1.0)\n              .to(\".js-ui-bottom-right\", { x: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 1.2 }, 1.1);\n\n            // Magnetic Button Effect (Amazing distinct interaction instead of floating)\n            document.querySelectorAll('.js-magnetic').forEach(elem => {\n                elem.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                    const rect = elem.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    const x = (e.clientX - rect.left - rect.width / 2) * 0.3;\n                    const y = (e.clientY - rect.top - rect.height / 2) * 0.3;\n                    gsap.to(elem, { x: x, y: y, duration: 0.4, ease: \"power2.out\", overwrite: true });\n                });\n                elem.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                    gsap.to(elem, { x: 0, y: 0, duration: 0.7, ease: \"elastic.out(1, 0.4)\", overwrite: true });\n                });\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aether-metrics-orbital-scheduling.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/aether-metrics-orbital-scheduling.jpg", "source_name": "aether-metrics-orbital-scheduling-DESIGN.md", "views": 38, "forks": 0, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "1a62ed4c-6d0d-4900-8de2-1f3139579949", "created_at": "2026-06-21T11:39:54.279152+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T06:36:51.294431+00:00"}